    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "The textbox when making a ticket doesn't feel nice",
      "body": "Also I can't ctrl+a copy paste or what",
      "status": "in_progress",
      "priority": "high",
      "labels": [
        "tickets"
      ],
      "assignee": null,
      "created": 1788448806,
      "updated": 1788450439,
      "anchors": [
        {
          "file": "crates/pm-ui/src/text_input.rs",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 1,
          "rev": "working"
        }
      ],
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788449600,
          "body": "Rewrote text_input: selection model + shift-motions, Ctrl+A, cut/copy/paste, Ctrl+Backspace word delete, Up/Down in multiline, and a 1px caret quad that no longer shifts the text. Click focuses the field. Still missing: click-to-place-caret mid-text (needs glyph geometry) — tracked as follow-up.",
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788450076,
          "body": "Still feels awkward. Especially when selecting/highlighting a character from a word you can see each letters jumping. Perhaps we need to see a solution from how zed implements textboxes.",
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788450439,
          "body": "Can't even jump the caret to other section freely with mouse cursor click",
          "anchor": null
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "author": "reaganiwadha",
          "created": 1788460000,
          "body": "Rebuilt text_input the gpui/Zed way (crates/gpui/examples/input.rs): TextInput is now its own entity with a custom Element that shapes each line once via shape_line and paints it as a single ShapedLine — no more glyph jumping. Text arrives through the OS IME pipeline (window.handle_input + EntityInputHandler), so dead keys/compose/AltGr work. Mouse: click places the caret, drag selects, shift-click extends. Editing is actions bound under a 'TextInput' key context in main.rs (Ctrl+A/C/X/V, Ctrl+arrows, Ctrl+Backspace, Home/End, shift-motions, Up/Down); Enter submits single-line, inserts newline in multiline. Single-line fields scroll horizontally to keep the caret visible. Not done: soft-wrap, undo/redo. Needs a run to verify (blocked by a running pm.exe here).",
          "anchor": null
        }
      ]
    },
